<title>USA: Fine Host buys N.J. food service business.</title>
<headline>Fine Host buys N.J. food service business.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fine Host Corp said on Thursday that it has acquired a private, Northern New Jersey-based contract food services management company, which generates about $8 million in annual revenues.</p>
<p>The company's name and the purchase price were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Fine Host said the New Jersey company marks its entry into the New Jersey market, where it will provide contract food services to school districts and corporate dining markets.</p>
</text>
